"Musculation":["Séries classiques","Superset","Biset","Triset","Giant set","Pyramidal","Drop set","Rest-pause","Cluster","Tempo","Pause reps","Pré-fatigue","Post-fatigue","Circuit musculaire","Unilatéral"],
"Cross Training":["AMRAP","EMOM","E2MOM","E3MOM","For Time","Rounds For Time","Chipper","Ladder","Tabata","HIIT","Circuit Training","Intervalles","Work/Rest","Team Workout","You Go I Go","Relais","Ateliers"],
"HYROX":["Run + Station","Compromised Running","Technique stations","Force spécifique","Endurance de force","Transitions","Pacing","Simulation partielle","Simulation complète","Circuit préparatoire"],
"Cardio":["Continu","Endurance fondamentale","Intervalles courts","Intervalles longs","30/30","Fartlek","Tempo","Seuil","HIIT","Côtes","Sortie longue","Progressif"],
"Running / Trail":["Continu","Endurance fondamentale","Intervalles courts","Intervalles longs","30/30","Fartlek","Tempo","Seuil","Côtes","Sortie longue","Progressif"],
"Boxe / Combat":["Technique","Shadow boxing","Sac","Pattes d’ours","Déplacements","Défense","Combinaisons","Rounds","Vitesse","Puissance","Conditionnement","Circuit boxe"],
"Renforcement / Poids du corps":["Séries classiques","Circuit Training","Tempo","AMRAP","EMOM"],
"Mobilité / Souplesse":["Flow","Mobilité active","Étirements dynamiques","Étirements statiques"],
"Collectif":["Ateliers","Stations","Relais","Binômes","Team Workout","You Go I Go","Circuit Training"]
